{"title":"Cabbage","sourceTitle":"Cabbage/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Cabbage/de\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Kohl (4% translated)\" lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">Deutsch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Cabbage\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Cabbage (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Cabbage/es\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Repollo (11% translated)\" lang=\"es\" dir=\"ltr\">español</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Cabbage/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Chou (52% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Cabbage/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Капуста (100% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Cabbage/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"卷心菜 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"center\" style=\"background-color: #eee; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 4px; border-color: #88acf5; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 85%; width: 90%; padding: 0.2em; margin: 0.5em auto; margin-left:0px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; align-items: center; padding-left: 10px\">\n<div style=\"margin-left: 10px; text-align: left;\">\n<p>Esta página foi verificada pela última vez para a versão do Vintage Story <b>1.19.0-pre.10</b>.\n</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<p><br />\n<b>Cabbages</b> são uma fonte de alto teor vegetal <a href=\"/Satiety\" title=\"Satiety\">nutrição</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"float:right;\">\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:300px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Repolho</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Grid_cabbage.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/0/08/Grid_cabbage.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"100\" data-file-height=\"100\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Empilhável</b>\n</td>\n<td>64<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Comida</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Saciedade</b>\n</td>\n<td>300 cru, <br />450 em Refeições\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Categoria</b>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Legume\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Transitável</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Tempo fresco</b>\n</td>\n<td>21 dias\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Rot#Notes\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Rot\">Tempo de apodrecimento</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>4 dias\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Rot#Notes\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Rot\">Taxa de apodrecimento</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>0.5<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Items\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Itens</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Obtendo\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Obtendo</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Cultivo\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Cultivo</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Uso\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Uso</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Armazenamento\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Armazenamento</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Histórico\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Histórico</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Observações\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Observações</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Galeria\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Galeria</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Veja_também\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Veja também</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Referências\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Referências</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p><span id=\"Obtaining\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtendo\">Obtendo</span></h2>\n<p>Repolhos <i>não</i> crescem na natureza.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Sementes de repolho só podem ser <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/trading\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/trading\">comprado</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Trading\" title=\"Trading\"> </a></span> de um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Trading\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Trading\">comerciante agrícola</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Trading\" title=\"Trading\"> </a></span>,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> ou encontradas em um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cracked_Vessel\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cracked Vessel\">vaso rachado</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cracked_Vessel\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cracked Vessel\"> </a></span>,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> que pode ser encontrado em <a href=\"/Ruin\" title=\"Ruin\">ruínas</a> acima ou abaixo do solo. \n5-7 sementes de repolho podem <abbr title=\"a 0.11 chance\">sometimes</abbr> ser encontradas em um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cracked_Vessel\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cracked Vessel\">Vaso rachado (Semente)</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cracked_Vessel\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cracked Vessel\"> </a></span>.\n2-4 sementes de repolho podem <abbr title=\"a 0.75 chance\">sometimes</abbr> ser encontradas em um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cracked_Vessel\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cracked Vessel\">Vaso rachado (Agricultura)</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cracked_Vessel\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cracked Vessel\"> </a></span>.\n</p><p><span id=\"Cultivation\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Cultivo\">Cultivo</span></h2>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/File:Cabbage-fully-grown-crop.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/2/20/Cabbage-fully-grown-crop.png/200px-Cabbage-fully-grown-crop.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"157\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/2/20/Cabbage-fully-grown-crop.png/300px-Cabbage-fully-grown-crop.png 1.5x, /images/2/20/Cabbage-fully-grown-crop.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"396\" data-file-height=\"310\" /></a><figcaption>Repolho maduro</figcaption></figure>\n<p>As culturas de repolho toleram temperaturas de -5°C a 35°C.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Se a temperatura cair abaixo de -5°C ou exceder 35°C, a cultura de repolho se tornará <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Temperature#Effect_on_plants\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Temperature\">\"atrofiado\"</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Temperature#Effect_on_plants\" title=\"Temperature\"> </a></span> e começará a acumular danos. As colheitas de repolho atrofiadas produzirão 50% do normal quando colhidas. Se acumularem danos suficientes para morrerem por frio ou calor excessivo, as colheitas de repolho produzirão 50% do normal quando colhidas<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> mas o jogador tem garantida 1 semente, independentemente do estágio de crescimento.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>As culturas de repolho consomem 40<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-9\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming#Soil_nutrients\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">N (nitrogênio)</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming#Soil_nutrients\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span> do solo em 12 estágios<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-10\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-10\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>10<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> de crescimento.\nDurante os estágios 2 a 11, as culturas de repolho alimentam <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bees\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bees\">abelhas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bees\" title=\"Bees\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Butterfly\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Butterfly\">borboletas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Butterfly\" title=\"Butterfly\"> </a></span>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-11\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-11\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>11<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> As culturas de repolho levam <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming#Time\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">1,5 meses</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming#Time\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-12\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-12\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>12<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> para amadurecer, (14 dias nas configurações <abbr title=\"9 day per month\">default</abbr>, assumindo uma taxa de crescimento próxima de 100%. Baixo <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming#Moisture\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">umidade</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming#Moisture\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span> ou <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming#Soil_nutrients\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">níveis de nutrientes</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming#Soil_nutrients\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span> podem atrasar significativamente a maturação.\n</p><p>As couves podem ser colhidas \n<abbr title=\"Botão esquerdo do mouse\">quebrando</abbr> da colheita, não é necessário <abbr title=\"a scythe harvests more blocks at once\">tool</abbr>. \nCada bloco de colheitas de repolho maduro produzirá 2 pacotes de sementes de repolho<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-13\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-13\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>13<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> e <abbr title=\"one with a 20% chance of a second\">1-2</abbr>. A colheita no estágio 11 tem 85% de chance de obter 1 repolho<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-14\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-14\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>14<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> e 99% de chance de obter 1 pacote de sementes. A colheita antes do estágio 11 tem 0% de chance de obter repolho e 70% de chance de obter 1 pacote de sementes.\n</p><p><span id=\"Usage\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uso\">Uso</span></h2>\n<p>Quando comido cru, o repolho fornece 300 vegetais <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/satiety\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/satiety\">saciedade</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Satiety\" title=\"Satiety\"> </a></span>, o que é três vezes mais do que a maioria dos vegetais.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-15\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-15\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>15<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>As couves podem ser usadas como ingrediente vegetal em ensopados, sopas, mingaus e tortas. \n</p><p><span id=\"Storage\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Armazenamento\">Armazenamento</span></h2>\n<p>Como todos os alimentos, as couves beneficiam do armazenamento num <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Room#Cellar\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Room\">despensa</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Room#Cellar\" title=\"Room\"> </a></span> e tendem a beneficiar do armazenamento em recipientes durante o tempo frio. O recipiente de armazenamento de argila é o melhor recipiente para repolhos, devido à sua propriedade de reduzir o índice de perecibilidade dos vegetais.\nAs couves podem ser conservadas via <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Food_preservation#Pickling\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Food preservation\">decapagem</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Food_preservation#Pickling\" title=\"Food preservation\"> </a></span> e beneficiar do armazenamento em <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Room#Cellar\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Room\">despensa</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Room#Cellar\" title=\"Room\"> </a></span>.\n</p><p><span id=\"History\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Hist.C3.B3rico\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Histórico\">Histórico</span></h2>\n<p><span id=\"Notes\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Observa.C3.A7.C3.B5es\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Observações\">Observações</span></h2>\n<p><span id=\"Gallery\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Galeria\">Galeria</span></h2>\n<p><span id=\"See&#95;also\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Veja_tamb.C3.A9m\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Veja_também\">Veja também</span></h2>\n<p><span id=\"References\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Refer.C3.AAncias\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Referências\">Referências</span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap mw-references-columns\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Linha 3 de %appdata%\\Roaming\\Vintagestory\\assets\\survival\\itemtypes\\food\\vegetable.json</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Linhas 118-124 de %appdata%\\Roaming\\Vintagestory\\assets\\survival\\itemtypes\\food\\vegetable.json</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-3\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">find source</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-4\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Line 308 of %appdata%\\Roaming\\Vintagestory\\assets\\survival\\entities\\humanoid\\comerciante-agriculture.json</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-5\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Line 21 of %appdata%\\Roaming\\Vintagestory\\assets\\survival\\blocktypes\\clay\\lootvessel.json</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-6\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-6\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Line 42 of [<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/anegostudios/vsessentialsmod/blob/master/Loading\\BlockCropPropertiesType.cs\">BlockCropPropertiesType.cs|Carregando\\BlockCropPropertiesType.cs BlockCropPropertiesType.cs</a>] and line 79 of %appdata%\\Roaming\\Vintagestory\\assets\\survival\\blocktypes\\plant\\crop\\cabbage.json</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-7\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-7\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Lines 43-44 of [<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/anegostudios/vsessentialsmod/blob/master/Loading/BlockCropPropertiesType.cs\">BlockCropPropertiesType.cs</a>]</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-8\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-8\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Lines 58-66 of [<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/anegostudios/vssurvivalmod/blob/master/BlockEntity/BEDeadCrop.cs\">BEDeadCrop.cs</a>]</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-9\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-9\">↑</a></span> <span class=\